<p>The safest conclusion is conditional: use the official domain, preserve the exact order, judge only what QC evidence can show, resolve errors in China, compare eligible shipping routes and keep complete records. Buyers who treat the agent as a system of checkpoints have more control than buyers who treat it as a seal of approval.</p>
