<p>Sugargoo’s official shipping guidance describes a freight-estimation tool that asks for destination and parcel information, and its package-simulation guidance explains why measured weight and dimensions matter. That distinction is essential. An early estimate supports budgeting; a packed parcel provides the evidence used for the final route calculation. Use the calculator below to understand the math, not to replace current route terms inside your account.</p>

